MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- UI/Android/app/src/main/java/org/ladybird/androidport/WebContentService.kt:
  - Android Service running in isolated :webcontent process for renderer isolation
  - Mirrors upstream Ladybird multi-process architecture (fork+exec → Android Service)
  - WebContentNative JNI bridge (initialize/loadURL/shutdown)
  - Stubs for LibWeb::Page + JS::VM init in service process
- UI/Android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml: Register WebContentService with android:process=:webcontent
- UI/Android/app/src/main/cpp/LadybirdEngine.cpp: Add JNI functions for WebContentNative (initialize/loadURL/shutdown)
- UI/Android/README.md: Full build instructions, architecture diagram, testing guide, known issues

Browser architecture now complete:
  MainActivity → LadybirdWebView → SurfaceView → NativeBridge JNI
  → AndroidViewImplementation → WebContentProcess (pthread)
  → LibWebAndroid → LibWeb::Page + JS::VM (stubs until vcpkg completes)
  + WebContentService (Android Service, :webcontent process) for renderer isolation

Bootstrap APK builds and runs. Next: vcpkg manifest complete → link LibWeb/LibJS → real HTML rendering.
